    "h1": { "en": "Touch end", "zh": "触控机构" },
    "lede": { "en": "Mount the capacitive stylus tip onto the push-pull solenoid, then install the two together onto the X carriage.", "zh": "把电容触控笔尖装到推拉式电磁铁上，再将两者一起装到 X 滑座上。" }
  },
