        "body": { "en": "Six screws hold the solenoid assembly to the clamp. To adjust the stylus height later, undo them and refit at a different hole pair.", "zh": "电磁铁总成用六颗螺栓固定在夹具上。以后调整触控笔高度时，松开螺栓，换一对孔重新安装。" },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
